    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astronook is a relaxing astronomy game where you return to your late grandpa\u2019s study. Take up stargazing, astrophotography and discover cosmic wonders; all with a warm beverage at hand. Your study may be small, but through your telescope, a whole new cosmos is now within reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503880/extras/da1c18950b6f12283b53fe9830ed99ce.poster.avif?t=1749485365\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503880/extras/da1c18950b6f12283b53fe9830ed99ce.webm?t=1749485365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503880/extras/da1c18950b6f12283b53fe9830ed99ce.mp4?t=1749485365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore space at your own pace from the comfort of your snug study room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Map out <strong>magical constellations</strong> in star-mapping puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 Use your star chart to find and <strong>photograph a variety of charming planets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2604\ufe0f Keep tabs on the latest cosmic news - who knows what <strong>celestial wonders</strong> you'll find?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd2 Print your photos and fill up your <strong>stargazer\u2019s scrapbook</strong> with all your discoveries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c Experience a quiet but personal\u00a0<strong>heartfelt narrative</strong> that unfolds as you play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503880/extras/9909f3b6f346b136a6e3dbfb1de759b5.poster.avif?t=1749485365\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503880/extras/9909f3b6f346b136a6e3dbfb1de759b5.webm?t=1749485365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503880/extras/9909f3b6f346b136a6e3dbfb1de759b5.mp4?t=1749485365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
